      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TALK TOO MUCH (1) was speedy out of box 4 on debut to score by 5 lengths (16.94) at this track over 300m. Drawn to take advantage of good early pace. Can measure up again. INDIGO BEACH (2) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fourth (17.78) in a Grade 5 at this track. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Expected to feature in the finish. BUNDOCK CRITTER (3) jumped quickly from box four to score (17.44) two back then drew the same last time but settled off pace and could manage only a 16 length 6th at this track (24.61). Key runner who gets his chance to atone. MAKE A RUPEE (8) is one of the chances after collecting a minor prize last time.",
